---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = '三狮生物｜赛鸽基因检测·病毒检测·试剂设备一体化方案';
const description =
  '河北三狮生物科技有限公司专注赛鸽飞行能力基因检测、赛鸽病毒检测及分子诊断试剂设备研发生产，提供设备+试剂+培训一条龙服务，覆盖LDHA、DRD4、CRY1等8项飞行能力基因与10种鸽病原体检测。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-700 via-brand-600 to-deep-600 text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, white 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>
    <div class="container-site relative py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-white/15 px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium backdrop-blur">基因检测技术 · AI 基因育种 · 高新技术企业</span>
        <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl">
          让每一羽赛鸽<br />天赋<span class="text-brand-200">看得见</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-50">
          三狮生物以基因检测技术为核心，为赛鸽行业提供<b>飞行能力基因检测</b>、<b>病毒病原体检测</b>、
          <b>试剂设备销售</b>及实验室建设培训一体化解决方案，帮助鸽友科学育种、精准选育。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/flight-ability" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 shadow hover:bg-brand-50">飞行能力基因检测</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-white/40 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10">立即咨询</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 三大核心业务 -->
  <section class="container-site -mt-10 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <a href="/flight-ability" class="card group hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 3v18h18M7 14l3-4 3 3 4-6" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700">飞行能力基因检测</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          检测 LDHA、DRD4、CRY1、MSTN 等 8 项与飞行能力相关的关键基因，从基因层面评估赛鸽耐力、归巢、导航、肌力与智商潜力。
        </p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-600">了解更多 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/virus-detection" class="card group hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 2a7 7 0 00-4 12.7V17a2 2 0 002 2h4a2 2 0 002-2v-2.3A7 7 0 0012 2zM9 22h6" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700">赛鸽病毒检测</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          覆盖鸽新城疫、鸽疱疹、鸽圆环、鸽腺病毒、沙门氏菌等 10 种常见病原体，荧光定量 PCR 精准早筛，守护鸽群健康。
        </p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-600">了解更多 →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/products" class="card group hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-md transition">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700">
          <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 3.104v5.714a2.25 2.25 0 01-.659 1.591L5 14.5M9.75 3.104c-.251.023-.501.05-.75.082m.75-.082a24.301 24.301 0 014.5 0m0 0v5.714c0 .597.237 1.17.659 1.591L19.8 15.3M14.25 3.104c.251.023.501.05.75.082M19.8 15.3l-1.57.393A9.065 9.065 0 0112 15a9.065 9.065 0 00-6.23-.693L5 14.5m14.8.8l1.402 1.402c1.232 1.232.65 3.318-1.067 3.611A48.309 48.309 0 0112 21c-2.773 0-5.491-.235-8.135-.687-1.718-.293-2.3-2.379-1.067-3.61L5 14.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700">试剂设备销售</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          便携式实时荧光定量 PCR 仪 Q162D、全自动核酸提取仪 ES08，配套热启动 Taq 酶、qPCR 试剂盒等分子诊断试剂。
        </p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-600">了解更多 →</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 公司简介 + 数字 -->
  <section class="container-site py-20">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <span class="badge">关于三狮</span>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-3">以基因检测为核心的<br />动植物分子诊断与育种企业</h2>
        <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          三狮生物坐落于石家庄国际生物医药产业园，由「国家重大人才工程入选者」发起创立，
          专注动植物基因检测技术与 AI 基因育种技术，形成<b>检测设备与检测试剂开发制造、
          智能数据模型开发、实验室建设与技术培训</b>三位一体的产业布局。
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          公司已通过 ISO9001 质量体系认证，推出产品 300 余种，覆盖食品安全检测、动植物检测、基因育种、生物智造等多个领域。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <a href="/about" class="btn-outline">了解企业详情</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600">300+</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">产品品类</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600">22</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">专利技术</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600">8</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">飞行能力基因项</div>
        </div>
        <div class="card text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-600">10</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">病原体检测种类</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 服务流程 -->
  <section class="bg-slate-50 py-20">
    <div class="container-site">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="badge">服务流程</span>
        <h2 class="section-title mt-3">五步完成赛鸽基因检测</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">从采样到报告，简单高效，幼鸽即可检测</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
        {[
          ['01', '咨询下单', '确定检测项目，联系客服下单'],
          ['02', '羽毛采样', '洗净双手，拔取4-6根胸腹部羽毛风干'],
          ['03', '寄送样本', '按客服指引快递至实验室'],
          ['04', 'DNA 鉴定', '实验室提取核酸并进行基因检测'],
          ['05', '出具报告', '生成检测报告并解读结果'],
        ].map(([n, t, d]) => (
          <div class="card relative text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-600 text-sm font-bold text-white">{n}</div>
            <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-slate-900">{t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">{d}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 检测项目速览 -->
  <section class="container-site py-20">
    <div class="text-center">
      <span class="badge">检测项目</span>
      <h2 class="section-title mt-3">全面覆盖赛鸽育种与健康管理</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {[
        ['飞行能力基因检测', '8项基因评估耐力、归巢、导航、肌力、羽翼、记忆、阴雨天定向、智商', '/flight-ability'],
        ['病毒病原体检测', '10种病原体荧光定量PCR早筛', '/virus-detection'],
        ['幼鸽性别鉴定', '雌雄基因检测，早期确定性别', '/services'],
        ['基因身份证', '58个SNP位点二代测序，个体识别', '/services'],
        ['AB鸽检测', '58基因位点比对，亲缘与个体识别', '/services'],
        ['亲缘鉴定', '亲子关系与血统溯源', '/services'],
      ].map(([t, d, href]) => (
        <a href={href} class="card group hover:border-brand-300 transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-700">{t}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">{d}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="container-site pb-20">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-700 to-deep-600 px-8 py-12 text-center text-white sm:px-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">准备开启科学育种之路？</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-brand-50">设备、试剂、培训一条龙，三狮生物为您提供全流程分子检测支持。</p>
      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/contact" class="rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-50">联系我们</a>
        <a href="/products" class="rounded-lg border border-white/40 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10">浏览产品</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
